{%- comment -%}
  Central image source registry.

  Keep callers on stable semantic keys. Change only the source value here when
  an image moves. A source can be a theme asset filename or an absolute URL.

  Usage:
    {% render 'easify-image-url', image: 'mascotHero' %}
    {% render 'easify-image-url', image: 'mascotHero', width: 800 %}
    {% render 'easify-image-url', image: 'mascotHero', format: 'json' %}
{%- endcomment -%}

